neural crest in Xenopus</article-title><source>Current Topics in Developmental Biology</source><year>1999</year><volume>43</volume><fpage>85</fpage><lpage>113</lpage><comment>85&#x02013;113</comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9891884</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Le Douarin</surname><given-names>NM</given-names></name><name><surname>Dupin</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Multipotentiality of the neural crest</article-title><source>Current Opinion in Genetics &#x00026; Development</source><year>2003</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>529</fpage><lpage>536</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14550420</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.gde.2003.08.002</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Nieto</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The early steps of neural crest development</article-title><source>Mechanisms of Development</source><year>2001</year><volume>105</volume><fpage>27</fpage><lpage>35</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11429279</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0925-4773(01)00394-X</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Aybar</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Mayor</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Early induction of neural crest cells: lessons learned from frog, fish and chick</article-title><source>Current Opinion in Genetics &#x00026; Development</source><year>2002</year><volume>12</volume><fpage>452</fpage><lpage>458</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12100892</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0959-437X(02)00325-8</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Knecht</surname><given-names>AK</given-names></name><name><surname>Bronner-Fraser</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Induction of the neural crest: A multigene process</article-title><source>Nature Reviews Genetics</source><year>2002</year><volume>3</volume><fpage>453</fpage><lpage>461</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12042772</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/nrm832</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Huang</surname><given-names>X</given-names></name><name><surname>Saint-Jeannet</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Induction of the neural crest and the opportunities of life on the edge</article-title><source>Dev Biol</source><year>2004</year><volume>275</volume><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>11</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15464568</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.ydbio.2004.07.033</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Barembaum</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Bronner-Fraser</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Early steps in neural crest specification</article-title><source>Seminars in Cell &#x00026; Developmental Biology</source><year>2005</year><volume>16</volume><fpage>642</fpage><lpage>646</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16039882</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.semcdb.2005.06.006</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ledouarin</surname><given-names>NM</given-names></name><name><surname>Smith</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Lelievre</surname><given-names>CS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>From the Neural Crest to the Ganglia of the Peripheral Nervous-System</article-title><source>Annual Review of Physiology</source><year>1981</year><volume>43</volume><fpage>653</fpage><lpage>671</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7011203</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1146/annurev.ph.43.030181.003253</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Le Douarin</surname><given-names>NM</given-names></name><name><surname>Creuzet</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Couly</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Dupin</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Neural crest cell plasticity and its limits</article-title><source>Development</source><year>2004</year><volume>131</volume><fpage>4637</fpage><lpage>50</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15358668</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1242/dev.01350</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kelsh</surname><given-names>RN</given-names></name><name><surname>Schmid</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Eisen</surname><given-names>JS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Genetic analysis of melanophore development in zebrafish embryos</article-title><source>Dev Biol</source><year>2000</year><volume>225</volume><fpage>277</fpage><lpage>93</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10985850</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1006/dbio.2000.9840</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B23"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rawls</surname><given-names>JF</given-names></name><name><surname>Mellgren</surname><given-names>EM</given-names></name><name><surname>Johnson</surname><given-names>SL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>How the zebrafish gets its stripes</article-title><source>Developmental Biology</source><year>2001</year><volume>240</volume><fpage>301</fpage><l